                    "body_html":  "\u003cp data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"639\"\u003eSavor the authentic taste of \u003cstrong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"409\"\u003eMix Chavanu\u003c/strong\u003e, a crunchy and flavorful \u003cstrong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"461\"\u003eGujarati namkeen snack\u003c/strong\u003e handcrafted by \u003cstrong data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"497\"\u003eBhagvat Prasadam\u003c/strong\u003e. Made from \u003cstrong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"558\"\u003epremium lentils, peanuts, and aromatic spices\u003c/strong\u003e, this \u003cstrong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"584\"\u003emixture namkeen\u003c/strong\u003e delivers the perfect balance of taste and tradition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eA timeless favorite among \u003cstrong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"697\"\u003etraditional Indian namkeen\u003c/strong\u003e, our \u003cstrong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"718\"\u003eMix Namkeen\u003c/strong\u003e is ideal for \u003cstrong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"796\"\u003eDiwali snacks, festive gifting, or everyday tea-time delight\u003c/strong\u003e. Each bite is a crunchy blend of flavors that celebrates authenticity and purity. Bring home this \u003cstrong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"917\"\u003espicy Indian snack\u003c/strong\u003e and enjoy a delicious part of India’s snacking heritage.\u003c/p\u003e",
